{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026MIPtguvjDT1793319761.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>友邦保險截至九月底止第三季度新業務價值按年跌百分之4。</p><p></p><p>至14.15億美元，反映香港及內地業務下滑，但部分被其他分部的一成八新業務價值增長所抵銷。</p><p></p><p>新業務價值利潤率百分之63.5，增加5.3個百分點。年化新保費22.37億美元，跌一成二。公司表示，以強勁勢頭踏入第四季對前景保持信心。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T01:00:57.971747+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T23:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T03:58:21.470372+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T00:58:17.620666+00:00","content_hash":"b2404f8fd94a01d0c6924bc8bfa1ec07d6f0e482c533f8e5d2c0ef333b855d66","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T01:00:57.971747+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}